  "page": "page-06",
  "idea": "Automated holiday and time-off calendar sync across distributed teams",
  "text": "Avoid the frustration of assigning urgent tasks to engineers on national holidays abroad. Remote managers frequently schedule critical sprint deliverables without realizing international team members have local bank holidays. Missed handoffs create surprise delivery bottlenecks, blocking dependent features and frustrating clients waiting on product releases. Integrating Hibob with team Google Calendars automatically flags regional time-off and updates project timelines inside Asana. Your distributed sprints ship on schedule without friction.",
